          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[.9375rem] text-dim opacity-80">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#F8ECEC] text-[#943028] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
